95	// ZimmIcon), which re-exports the base SFCC icons barrel and hits the same top-level side-effect
96	// crash testing.md's "Known gap: ZimmIcon throws under Vitest" documents — mocking ZimmIcon alone
97	// (above) does not cover this second, direct import path. ZimmAuthDrawerContent already has its
98	// own exhaustive suite (zimmAuthDrawerContent/index.test.tsx); this container's own contract is
99	// only that it wires useWishlistAuthDrawer's returned values into it, not that the drawer content
100	// itself renders correctly.
